[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0697","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0697.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0958","title":"Sun HotJava Browser 3.0 任意DOM访问漏洞","description":"Sun HotJava Browser 3.0 存在跨窗口 DOM 未授权访问漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在命名窗口中打开 javascript: URL，绕过同源策略限制，跨域访问目标网页的文档对象模型（DOM），进而窃取页面中的敏感信息如 Cookie、会话令牌及表单数据。攻击条件简单，仅需诱导用户访问恶意链接，无需身份认证。该漏洞影响 HotJava Browser 3.0 版本，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0958"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:51.370","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 Sun HotJava Browser 3.0，更换为现代主流浏览器（如 Firefox、Chrome）并保持自动更新。该浏览器已于 2000 年代停止支持，无安全补丁可用，继续使用将面临 DOM 访问、跨站脚本攻击等多重风险。作为临时缓解措施，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0349.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5428","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20322","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0958","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0958.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x2jf-2fvx-62g9/GHSA-x2jf-2fvx-62g9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/e1fa268f46af70c043d8fa3850aa13f3adaa5831/advisories/2022/04/EUVD-2000-0945.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0697.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0697.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0697.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0695","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0695.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0955","title":"Cisco Virtual Central Office 4000 (VCO/4K) SNMP MIB 用户名密码弱加密漏洞","description":"Cisco Virtual Central Office 4000 (VCO/4K) 5.1.3 版本中存在弱加密存储漏洞，设备将用户名和密码以弱加密方式存储在 SNMP MIB 中。具有 SNMP 社区字符串（community string）访问权限的远程攻击者可获取加密后的凭据，并通过暴力破解或逆向分析还原明文密码，进而获得设备管理权限。该漏洞影响 VCO/4K 系列设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，建议立即升级至修复版本或限制 SNMP 访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0955"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50.940","remediation":"升级 Cisco VCO/4K 至 5.1.4 及以上版本（Cisco 已于 2000 年发布修复版本）。如无法升级，在 SNMP 配置中限制 community strings 仅对可信管理站可读，禁用 SNMP 写入权限，将默认 community strings 改为强随机字符串，并配置 ACL 限定来源 IP。该产品已停服多年，建议迁移至受支持的替代平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a102600-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1885","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5425","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20372","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0955","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0955.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5h9h-c98x-gm88/GHSA-5h9h-c98x-gm88.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0955.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bf727d17-31c7-465f-93cc-30224bb130d5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0695.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0694","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0694.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0953","title":"Evolvable Shambala Server 4.5 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Evolvable Shambala Server 4.5 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者通过向目标服务器建立 TCP 连接后立即关闭连接，可导致服务器服务崩溃或资源耗尽，无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响 Shambala Server 4.5 版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危漏洞。目前厂商已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他替代产品。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0953"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50.670","remediation":"Shambala Server 4.5 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即停止使用该版本，迁移至受支持的替代产品。如无法立即下线，可在防火墙或网络边界配置规则，限制对 Shambala Server 端口的非信任来源访问，并禁用未使用的网络接口以降低攻击面。若业务需要继续运行，可考虑在应用前端部署反向代理或 IPS 设备过滤异常连接行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0134.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1778","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5345","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20282","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0953","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0953.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9vc2-9r44-hc96/GHSA-9vc2-9r44-hc96.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9a68db36-3d4a-4b9b-a4ac-4867f3f1ca8d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0694.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0693","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0693.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0951","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 索引目录信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 的索引服务器（Index Server）存在配置缺陷漏洞。当启用了索引服务且目录设置了 Index 属性时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 WebDAV（Web Distributed Authoring and Versioning）搜索功能向目标服务器发送特制请求，从而列举 Web 根目录下的目录结构，导致服务器敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 上运行的 IIS 5.0 版本，攻击者无需任何认证即可远程利用，危害等级中等，CVSS 评分为 5.0。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0951"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50.413","remediation":"升级至 Windows Server 2003 及以上版本自带 IIS 6.0/7.0，从根本上消除漏洞。若无法升级，通过 IIS 管理控制台禁用 WebDAV 扩展和索引服务 (Indexing Service)，或移除 WebDAV 映射 (修改注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\W3SVC\\Parameters\\DisableWebDAV 为 1)。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a100400-1.txt","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=272079","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1756","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5335","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20269","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0951","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0951.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2000-0951-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1070.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/webdav_iis.nasl","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0951.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0693.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0693.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0693.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0692","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0692.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0949","title":"LBNL Traceroute 堆溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"LBNL traceroute 1.4a5 及更早版本的 savestr 函数中存在堆溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 traceroute 程序的 -g 选项传递特制的参数触发堆缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 LBNL traceroute 1.4a5 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，可完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0949"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50.113","remediation":"建议升级 LBNL traceroute 至 1.4a5 之后的版本，或安装各发行版提供的安全更新：Debian 用户安装 traceroute 更新包，Red Hat 用户应用 RHSA-2000-078 补丁，Caldera 用户安装 CSSA-2000-034 更新。如无法升级，可移除 traceroute 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/traceroute）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0344.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0357.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-034.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001013","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-053.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-078.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1739","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-October/000025.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5311","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20252","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0949.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e