er`），并将 IOS 升级至 Cisco 官方修复版本（如 12.0(5)WC2 及以上）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0380.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0194.html","http://www.osvdb.org/444","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1846","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5415","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20330","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0945","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0945.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/MSFExploits/CISCO/MSF/DeviceManager_infos.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jgvj-mgv6-79x3/GHSA-jgvj-mgv6-79x3.json","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/routersploit/routersploit/modules/exploits/switch/cisco/CVE-2000-0945-pl.py","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9e3977ed9f15f6c486fe075e4eba82c46dc5b756/sara/PLIST"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0691.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0691.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0691.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0690","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0690.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0944","title":"CGI Script Center News Update 1.1 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"CGI Script Center News Update 1.1 存在密码更改验证缺陷，未对原始管理员密码进行充分校验，远程攻击者无需知道原始密码即可直接修改管理员密码，导致完全控制新闻管理系统。该漏洞源于密码修改功能中缺乏必要的身份验证机制，攻击者可通过直接向密码更改接口发送构造请求完成密码重置，危害严重。CVSS 评分 9.8，影响所有运行 News Update 1.1 的 Web 服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0944"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:49.477","remediation":"立即停止使用 News Update 1.1，该软件已停止维护且无官方补丁。作为替代方案，删除或禁用 CGI Script Center News Update 的全部 CGI 脚本，或通过 Web 服务器访问控制列表（如 Apache 的 `.htaccess` 或 Nginx 的 `allow/deny` 指令）限制对 `news_update.cgi` 的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信管理 IP 执行密码修改操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0402.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1881","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5433","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/179","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0944","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0944.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/bb1nfosec/Information-Security-Tasks/blob/db6246d933d2f37eda520cdc2f442477e45415b3/feeds/2026-06-07.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p48q-c4h7-vj6x/GHSA-p48q-c4h7-vj6x.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0690.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0690.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0689","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0689.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0942","title":"Microsoft Windows Indexing Service 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Microsoft Indexing Service 的 CiWebHitsFile 组件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过向 IIS 服务器发送带有恶意 CiRestriction 参数的 .htw 请求，在目标用户浏览器中执行任意脚本代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 及 NT 4.0 上的 IIS4/5 服务器，无需身份认证即可远程触发，可能导致会话劫持、信息窃取等危害。CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0942"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:49.197","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-006 提供的补丁，Windows 2000 用户下载安装 Indexing Services 补丁（KB251170），Windows NT 4.0 用户下载安装 Index Server 2.0 补丁。若无法立即打补丁，可在 IIS 管理器中移除 .htw 脚本映射或禁用 Indexing Service 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/141903","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1861","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-084","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5441","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20335","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0942.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0942.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee36