nayweb.bc.ca/scripts/whois.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1883","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5438","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20370","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0941","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0941.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/kw_whois.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4grc-97wg-m67h/GHSA-4grc-97wg-m67h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ba93596e-603a-46ce-9392-54af61bdff9b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0685","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0937","title":"Samba SWAT 登录失败日志缺失漏洞","description":"Samba Web 管理工具（SWAT）在 Samba 2.0.7 版本中存在登录日志记录缺陷，当用户名正确但密码错误时，系统不会记录该登录尝试日志，这为远程攻击者提供了隐蔽的暴力密码猜测攻击条件。攻击者无需提前认证即可通过自动化工具枚举有效密码，由于登录失败不会触发日志记录，攻击行为难以被管理员及时发现和追溯。该漏洞影响运行 Samba 2.0.7 并启用 SWAT Web 管理服务的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0937"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48.497","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.0.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 SWAT 登录审计缺失问题。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 中设置 hosts allow 限制 SWAT 管理页面仅允许内网可信 IP 访问，或在防火墙层面限制对 901 端口（SWAT 默认端口）的访问，同时在操作系统层面启用 SWAT 访问日志作为补充审计手段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0430.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1873","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5442","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20340","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0937","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0937.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-436h-wrjr-5hj3/GHSA-436h-wrjr-5hj3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8342d966-58f5-4768-a827-5118f3cdf20f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0684","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0684.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0936","title":"Samba SWAT 日志文件权限漏洞","description":"Samba 2.0.7 中的 Web 管理工具 SWAT（Samba Web Administration Tool）在安装时将 cgi.log 日志文件的权限设置为世界可读（world readable），导致本地攻击者能够读取该日志文件中的敏感信息，如用户密码等。该漏洞利用条件较低，攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限即可实施信息窃取，影响使用 Samba 2.0.7 版本且启用 SWAT 功能的系统。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0936"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48.367","remediation":"建议升级至 Samba 2.0.8 及以上版本，该版本已修复 cgi.log 日志文件权限问题。如无法升级，手动执行 chmod 600 /path/to/samba/swat/cgi.log 限制日志文件仅 root 可读写，同时在 smb.conf 中将 SWAT 的 bind interfaces only 设为 yes 并仅绑定 127.0.0.1 以减少本地攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0430.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1874","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5445","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20341","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0936.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0936.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0936","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0936.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0936.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8chm-8g8j-qf44/GHSA-8chm-8g8j-qf44.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0936.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/Parist0nH1ll/Vulnerabilities-Write-Ups/blob/fcbd13c8fefc4ed91efbeabd392a99370fc085b6/CVE-2000-0936/paper.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0684.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0684.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0682","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0935","title":"Samba SWAT cgi.log 符号链接本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Samba 2.0.7 中的 Web 管理工具（SWAT）存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过创建指向系统任意文件的恶意符号链接，当 SWAT 向 cgi.log 写入日志时，日志内容会被重定向写入被链接的目标文件，从而实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞影响 Samba 2.0.7 版本，需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0935"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48.227","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.0.8 或更高版本。如无法升级，可禁用 SWAT 服务（注释 swat 相关 xinetd 配置），并限制 /tmp 目录的粘滞位权限（chmod +t /tmp），防止本地用户通过符号链接攻击覆盖任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0430.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1872","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5443","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20339","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0935.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0935.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0935","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d21