929","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7 OCX 控件嵌入式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7 中的 OCX 嵌入式控件存在资源关闭不当漏洞（OCX Attachment 漏洞）。当使用支持 RTF 格式的电子邮件客户端打开包含特制 OCX 控件的邮件时，由于该控件未能被正确关闭，攻击者可远程触发拒绝服务，导致目标系统崩溃或无响应。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7 版本，利用条件简单，用户仅需预览或打开恶意 RTF 邮件即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0929"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47.363","remediation":"升级到 Windows Media Player 9 或更高版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，可在邮件客户端中禁用 ActiveX 控件运行，或使用非 RTF 格式查看邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97024839222747&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1714","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-068","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5309","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20240","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0929.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0929","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0929.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0929.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2f3p-79j4-gp2g/GHSA-2f3p-79j4-gp2g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0929.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e7dc7995-225b-48c7-bdd9-8588d1833e25.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/aRustyDev/C844/blob/720e0d7d36a1e205b5674cabfd4a2f792e75ee26/src/scans/10-168-27-15/10-168-27-15.vulscan-p445.nmap"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0680.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0680.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0680.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0679","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0679.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0926","title":"Smartwin Technology CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0 商品价格修改漏洞","description":"SmartWin CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0（又称 CyberShop）存在价格修改漏洞。远程攻击者可通过修改 HTML 表单中的隐藏字段 \"Price\" 变量值，以任意价格提交订单完成购买，导致商家遭受经济损失。该漏洞源于服务端未对客户端提交的价格数据进行有效性校验与签名，攻击者使用浏览器开发者工具或代理工具即可篡改价格参数，无需任何身份认证即可实施攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0926"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46.943","remediation":"对 SmartWin CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0，所有价格字段必须在服务端进行二次校验，禁止信任客户端提交的 Hidden 表单变量值。建议升级到已修复该问题的官方最新版本，如产品已停止维护，则替换为仍受支持的购物车系统（如 WooCommerce 或 Magento），并在迁移前通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截对价格字段的篡改请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0000.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97050627707128&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1733","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5319","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20247","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0926","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playgroun